  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あくの　そしきに　かいぞうされたテラキオン　と　あやしいざっしがとりあげた　ポケモンに　にている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "악의 조직에 개조당한 테라키온이라며 괴상한 잡지에서 다뤘던 포켓몬을 닮았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與可疑的雜誌當成被邪惡組織改造的代拉基翁來報導的寶可夢很相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble à un Terrakium qui, selon une revue douteuse, aurait été modifié par une organisation maléfique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ähnelt einem Pokémon, das eine fragwürdige Zeitschrift als ein Terrakium vorstellte, das von einer bösartigen Organisation modifiziert wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Recuerda a un Pokémon descrito en cierta revista de dudosa veracidad como \"un Terrakion modificado por una malvada organización\".",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ricorda un Pokémon descritto in una rivista di dubbia attendibilità come un Terrakion modificato da un’organizzazione malvagia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It resembles a Pokémon described in a dubious magazine as a Terrakion that had been modified by an evil organization.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "悪の　組織に　改造されたテラキオン　と　怪しい雑誌がとりあげた　ポケモンに　似ている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "与可疑杂志中提到的由邪恶组织改造代拉基翁而成的宝可梦长得很相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Recuerda a un Pokémon descrito en cierta revista de dudosa veracidad como \"un Terrakion modificado por una malvada organización\".",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きんぞくしつの　ボディらしい。なまえは　ふるい　ほんに　しるされたなぞの　ぶったいから　つけられた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸은 금속질로 되어 있다고 한다. 이름은 오래된 책에 기록된 정체불명의 물체에서 유래됐다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身體似乎是由金屬構成。牠的名字來自記載於古老書籍裡的神秘物體。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son corps serait composé de métal. Ce Pokémon doit son nom à une entité mystérieuse mentionnée dans un livre ancien.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es scheint einen Körper aus Metall zu haben. Seinen Namen erhielt es in Anlehnung an ein rätselhaftes Objekt aus einem alten Buch.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su cuerpo parece estar compuesto enteramente de metal. Debe su nombre a un objeto descrito en un tomo antiguo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sembra che il suo corpo sia composto di metallo. Deve il suo nome a un oggetto misterioso descritto in un vecchio libro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It was named after a mysterious object recorded in an old book. Its body seems to be metallic.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "金属質の　ボディらしい。名前は　古い　本に　記された謎の　物体から　つけられた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
